  data: {
    LLM: 'Focus on collecting high-value cards (kings, honours). In positive contracts, 36 points is the threshold - track your progress toward this goal.\n\nTalon selection is crucial. Evaluate both packets carefully before choosing. When calling a king, consider which suit you need help in.\n\nMaster the announcement strategy. Announcing bonuses doubles their value but commits you to achieving them. In negative contracts (Bettel, Piccolo), the strategy inverts - you must carefully lose tricks or win exactly the right number.',
    Player: 'Focus on collecting high-value cards (kings, honours). In positive contracts, 36 points is the threshold - track your progress toward this goal.\n\nTalon selection is crucial. Evaluate both packets carefully before choosing. When calling a king, consider which suit you need help in.\n\nMaster the announcement strategy. Announcing bonuses doubles their value but commits you to achieving them. In negative contracts (Bettel, Piccolo), the strategy inverts - you must carefully lose tricks or win exactly the right number.',
